      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"bold\">Why Quantum?</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">The crisis that broke classical physics (1900–1905)</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"180\" width=\"940\" height=\"160\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#6366f1\" opacity=\"0.18\"/><rect x=\"80\" y=\"180\" width=\"940\" height=\"160\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"230\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\">Classical Physics circa 1900</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"275\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"22\">Newton (motion) + Maxwell (light) + Thermodynamics (heat)</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"312\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">\"Physics is almost finished\" — the prevailing mood</text><polygon points=\"550,370 530,410 570,410\" fill=\"#f59e0b\"/><rect x=\"80\" y=\"430\" width=\"290\" height=\"200\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#ef4444\" opacity=\"0.18\"/><rect x=\"80\" y=\"430\" width=\"290\" height=\"200\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"225\" y=\"480\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\">Cloud 1</text><text x=\"225\" y=\"525\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"22\">Blackbody</text><text x=\"225\" y=\"560\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"22\">radiation</text><text x=\"225\" y=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Hot objects glow wrong</text><rect x=\"405\" y=\"430\" width=\"290\" height=\"200\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" opacity=\"0.18\"/><rect x=\"405\" y=\"430\" width=\"290\" height=\"200\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"480\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\">Cloud 2</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"525\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"22\">Photoelectric</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"560\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"22\">effect</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Light kicks out electrons oddly</text><rect x=\"730\" y=\"430\" width=\"290\" height=\"200\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#ec4899\" opacity=\"0.18\"/><rect x=\"730\" y=\"430\" width=\"290\" height=\"200\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"875\" y=\"480\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\">Cloud 3</text><text x=\"875\" y=\"525\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"22\">Atomic</text><text x=\"875\" y=\"560\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"22\">stability</text><text x=\"875\" y=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Atoms should collapse</text><polygon points=\"550,670 530,710 570,710\" fill=\"#f59e0b\"/><rect x=\"80\" y=\"730\" width=\"940\" height=\"180\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#10b981\" opacity=\"0.18\"/><rect x=\"80\" y=\"730\" width=\"940\" height=\"180\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"785\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\">The Quantum Revolution</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"830\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"22\">Planck (1900): energy comes in packets. Einstein (1905): light comes in packets.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"870\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Nature is grainy at the smallest scales — not smooth</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"1000\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Three failures of classical physics led to one revolutionary idea: quantization</text></svg>",
