      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"bold\">Quiz: The Classical Crisis</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">What exactly went 'catastrophically' wrong?</text><line x1=\"120\" y1=\"800\" x2=\"1000\" y2=\"800\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"120\" y1=\"800\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"220\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M 170 230 Q 300 450 520 670 Q 720 800 980 795\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-dasharray=\"14 10\"/><path d=\"M 150 795 Q 250 780 330 600 Q 420 430 540 500 Q 720 620 980 780\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"6\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"300\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\">Theory → ∞</text><text x=\"620\" y=\"470\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\">Experiment: finite</text><text x=\"560\" y=\"860\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"22\">Wavelength →</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"920\" width=\"880\" height=\"110\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#6366f1\" opacity=\"0.18\"/><rect x=\"120\" y=\"920\" width=\"880\" height=\"110\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"560\" y=\"965\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"22\">Think: where do the two curves disagree most violently,</text><text x=\"560\" y=\"1003\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">and what did that disagreement imply about total radiated energy?</text></svg>",
