     "explanation": "EPR accepted the correlations but rejected spooky influence. Assuming locality, the only sane explanation seemed to be that each particle carries pre-set answers — hidden variables — making ψ an incomplete summary, like twins sharing genes rather than communicating telepathically. EPR did NOT claim faster-than-light signaling (they rejected that). Bell's theorem later showed this seemingly airtight reasoning has experimentally testable consequences — which nature violates.",
