" y=\"830\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">and if answers exist that ψ doesn't list, what does that say about ψ?</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Twins-with-genes or spooky link? EPR chose pre-written answers — and indicted ψ as incomplete."
