      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"34\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">The Standard Model of Fields</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"150\" width=\"220\" height=\"140\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#6366f1\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"22\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Quark</text><text x=\"230\" y=\"245\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"18\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">fields</text><rect x=\"440\" y=\"150\" width=\"220\" height=\"140\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0ea5e9\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"22\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Lepton</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"245\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"18\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">fields (electron)</text><rect x=\"760\" y=\"150\" width=\"220\" height=\"140\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#10b981\"/><text x=\"870\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"22\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Gauge</text><text x=\"870\" y=\"245\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"18\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">boson fields</text><rect x=\"440\" y=\"330\" width=\"220\" height=\"140\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"390\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"22\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Higgs</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"425\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"18\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">field</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"560\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">all relativistic quantum fields, consistent with special relativity</text><rect x=\"130\" y=\"620\" width=\"840\" height=\"340\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"665\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Dirac's equation (1928)</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">combined quantum mechanics with special relativity</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"730\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">and predicted a mirror-image particle: antimatter</text><circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"820\" r=\"24\" fill=\"#0ea5e9\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"880\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">electron (e-)</text><circle cx=\"750\" cy=\"820\" r=\"24\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/><text x=\"750\" y=\"880\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">positron (e+)</text><line x1=\"400\" y1=\"820\" x2=\"700\" y2=\"820\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6,6\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"940\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">discovered experimentally in 1932, confirming QFT</text></svg>",
      "caption": "The Standard Model is a set of interacting relativistic quantum fields; Dirac's equation and the positron's discovery were its first proof of concept."
